OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment declines to wade into
OL,4,Abridge saga
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government will not intervene in a
OL,7,Fplanning saga over a long-awaited
OL,8,Fbridge in Grantham.
OL,10,FNorwich Hub and Buckminster Estates
OL,11,Fagreed to build the Pennine Way bridge
OL,12,F15 years ago as part of plans for 750
OL,13,Fnew homes, but says it is no longer
OL,14,Fneeded because of a new bypass.
OL,16,FIn May, South Kesteven District Council
OL,17,F(SKDC) rejected the developer's request
OL,18,Fto scrap the proposed bridge, subject
OL,19,Fto a referral to the housing secretary,
OL,20,Fwho has now said she will not step in
OL,21,Fand the matter should be decided
OL,22,Flocally.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
